WEBVTT

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:46.080
「The Mermaid's Sigh」 and
the Three Knights
Score 7

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.090
Ever since that incident, Gareki-kun has been really depressed.

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.640
That's understandable.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:03.770
She was like family to him; one week's just not enough time to cope with something like that.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.850
I have an idea.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.570
Nai-chan, Gareki-kun, you guys should come to the parade with us!

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:10.230
Um?

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:13.320
While it definitely takes time to recover from the loss of a loved one,

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.110
having an opportunity to take your mind off things helps too.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:19.320
Sure, I'll go.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:21.910
Wow.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.450
Darn it.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.090
Gareki, you look different.

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.460
What do you expect? I'm wearing different clothes.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:40.220
What Nai-chan means to say is that your new look is cool.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.600
At least, that's what I think.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.020
Why do I have to come?

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:45.350
It's a pain in the neck.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:50.350
Why are you guys having a show in the first place?
No one has conducted a full investigation.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:54.820
We're supporting the First Ship this time.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.780
Since we happen to be in the same town as them, they asked us to help out.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.410
There'll be many stands to choose from.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.700
It'll be fun.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.910
Isn't that right, Tsukumo-chan?

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:11.960
By the way, Tsukumo-chan, why did you choose that costume?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:13.960
Is something wrong?

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.410
Are you having fun, Gareki?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.030
Sort of.

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:50.750
<i>Yogi said something about Gareki losing his family.</i>

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:55.040
<i>I think “family” means someone you care about.</i>

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.630
<i>What does it mean to care about someone?</i>

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:05.430
Watch where you're going.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.910
<i>I get upset seeing Gareki depressed.</i>

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.710
<i>Is this what it means to care about someone?</i>

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.460
<i>How does it happen?</i>

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:36.550
<i>I was really happy when Gareki saved me.</i>

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.800
<i>Gareki was saved by Tsubaki-san too,</i>

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.890
<i>and they became family because of the bond they share.</i>

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.680
<i>And kindness is the foundation of that bond, isn't it?</i>

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:54.350
<i>But have I ever been kind to others?</i>

00:04:55.690 --> 00:05:00.570
<i>How can I fill that hole she left in his heart?</i>

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.780
<i>Karoku was also kind to me.</i>

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.070
<i>But still…</i>

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:12.080
<i>You'd better tell Gareki that you don't need him anymore.</i>

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.380
<i>Those words were scary.</i>

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.590
<i>Why would he say that?</i>

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.510
<i>I wonder where Karoku is right now.</i>

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:27.050
<i>And what should I do when I meet him?</i>

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.140
Wow, the Circus is so cool!

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.440
See, he has horns! Horns!
No, we aren't really…

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.270
That's so cool!
No, we aren't really…

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:35.520
Oh, oh, lemme touch 'em!

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:36.810
No, let <i>me</i> touch them!

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.320
Me, me!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.320
Man, Gareki-kun, you're a big hit with the kids, huh?

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:42.020
Please!
Man, Gareki-kun, you're a big hit with the kids, huh?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.950
Man, Gareki-kun, you're a big hit with the kids, huh?

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.240
Dammit. Get them away from me.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.200
Everyone, I've got some candy bars over here!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.250
Wow, candy bars!

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:52.710
All right, line up, everyone.
Wow, candy bars!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:53.700
All right, line up, everyone.

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:57.920
Hey, can I talk to you?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.210
What's that, Kiichi-chan? What happened?

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:04.970
Our high-performance rabbit, which is under maintenance, just got lost in the parade.

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.760
I'll have you take care of it.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.140
I'm sorry. I'm busy now.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.230
Here are the candy bars!

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:13.480
It's an emergency!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.220
Listen to me.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:19.230
Its defense functions are malfunctioning. It could attack the children!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:21.990
I'm a little busy right now.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:25.410
The rabbit's too fast to be caught by the Security Force.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:28.120
I'm the only one from the First Ship who could search for it.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.280
I'll go.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:30.240
What?

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:34.540
But you'll have to be on stage shortly, won't you?

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.460
Um… I'll go.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.710
Iva-neesan.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.130
I'll have to leave for a while.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.220
Please take care of Nai-chan and Gareki-kun for me, okay?

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.720
Oh <i>yeah</i>!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.850
<i>Did she even hear me?</i>

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.650
Now then, bye-bye perona!

00:07:02.030 --> 00:07:04.490
You're already saying bye-bye perona?

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:07.360
Bye-bye pero… na.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:10.160
Aren't you going to show us the “Sparkling Prince”?

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:11.410
You're leaving already?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.870
Don't you like us?

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:17.370
Of course I do! But first I need to take care of some work with my other cat friends.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:23.500
I… I'll give them candy bars.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:28.640
Nai-chan, I'm thankful for your offer, but you won't fit in this costume.

00:07:31.640 --> 00:07:33.340
Ah, Gareki-kun!

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:39.480
You're late!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.350
I'm sorry.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:43.730
What happened to your face?

00:07:45.780 --> 00:07:48.320
Haha, I met with some… resistance.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.450
Gareki? Where are you?

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.700
Yogi, Gareki disappeared!

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:05.210
What's wrong, Yogi?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.710
Nyanperona! Welcome back!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.300
Nyan-kichi.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.550
Hey, have you shrunk?

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.590
Your legs are sagging.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:15.590
Go higher! Higher!

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:17.810
Give us candy bars!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.100
Please!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:23.350
This must be today's best show.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.310
Iva-san!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.280
I can't find Gareki.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.990
Don't worry about it.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:34.320
Gareki-kun is delivering sweet dreams right beside us.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.200
It's hard work, you know.

00:08:38.040 --> 00:08:39.240
Damn it all!

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:47.340
Okay, we'll be rehearsing the last scene, the confession of love.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.250
Please give it your best shot!

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.680
Start!

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:56.890
Please accept my devoted love for you.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.770
Your beauty has stolen my heart away–

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.270
Excuse me, can you please…?

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.520
Is something wrong?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.400
Jiki-kun, it's not like you to make mistakes.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:15.780
No, it's not that. Tsukumo-chan, what's with that costume?

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.410
I'll wear the right costume during the real performance.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.530
Please do so.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.420
What's wrong?

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.290
It's nothing… I think.

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:38.140
I can't take it anymore. Where did that rabbit go?

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:40.680
It's not here, isn't it?

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.480
The rabbit has a red tag on its ear.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:45.440
Are you even <i>trying</i> to look for it?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.310
Why would I be here if I wasn't?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:51.690
You might rank highly like I do, but you fail your missions pretty frequently!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.820
I can't help but question your ability.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.280
You're always mentioning rank,

00:09:56.280 --> 00:10:00.700
but the scores we received on our recruitment exams mean nothing now.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.410
Oh <i>yes</i> they do!

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:06.910
If you don't complete the mission properly, it makes me look bad!

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:09.380
Kiichi-chan, calm down!

00:10:09.380 --> 00:10:13.760
Look at you! You hesitated because you sympathized with the opponent!

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.760
That, and you don't give it your all!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:16.800
Kiichi-chan!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.470
That kindness of yours makes me sick!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:27.150
If you stop for one individual, you won't be able to protect everyone else!

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:33.440
You may be right about that, but… everyone else…?

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.700
Wait, that's it!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:39.280
If the rabbit's defense functions are malfunctioning,

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.490
it'll probably go to a place with more  people to try and protect them!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:44.870
The theater at the plaza!

00:10:49.090 --> 00:10:51.790
<i>I hope they found the rabbit.</i>

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:53.460
Come in.

00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.210
Tsukumo-chan, are you ready?

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.600
Thank you for helping the First Ship.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:05.100
I'm more than happy to play the role of your lover.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:08.020
That's an incorrect interpretation.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.350
The story depicts the egoistic feelings of a young general.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.110
He abducted a mermaid he was attracted to for his own selfish desires.

00:11:15.450 --> 00:11:19.360
You shouldn't mistake the theme of this–

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:23.700
Well, yes! You're right.

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.330
Let's see, let me check the apparatus!

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:31.330
When I sit down on the bed, the bottom of the bottle you are in will open.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:34.960
So, you should hide yourself amongst the bubbles and get out of the bottle that way.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:39.550
The scene where the mermaid escapes from the sealed bottle will shock the audience.

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:40.800
That's the highlight of the play.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.060
Let's do our best.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:42.930
All right.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:49.980
Filled with the power of a man's spirit,

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:54.100
I'm the Sparkling Prince who makes your hearts throb!

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:59.610
The drink I gave you earlier was a drug that'll turn you into a human.

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.450
I will not make you the King's gift.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:08.120
When you become human, you will be mine on that bed tonight.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:11.370
Such a nasty guy.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:13.090
He has such leering eyes.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.880
Please escape, mermaid princess!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.970
I will now close the lid.

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:21.260
As a human, the longest you can remain underwater is a few minutes at most.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:25.640
I hope you understand your only one choice lies with me.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.280
I will wait for you on the bed.

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:42.370
The bottom of the bottle looks unsealed.

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:44.110
I think it's broken!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.370
I'll seal it now.

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.870
Good work.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.210
That bastard!

00:12:55.300 --> 00:12:57.300
Ga-Gareki?

00:12:57.300 --> 00:13:00.550
Ah… Yogi?

00:13:01.680 --> 00:13:03.180
I'll kill him.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:09.050
Tsukumo's show will be over soon, so you should rest now.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.650
What? Tsukumo-chan?

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:13.690
Ah?

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.890
She's saying something.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.190
Let's see…

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.900
What is it?

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.400
Is it your specialty, that super hearing power again?

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:26.160
Can't breathe… Can't open… No air...

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:44.510
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:52.020
<i>If I break the glass, I might hurt the audience in the front row.</i>

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.350
<i>The water's…</i>

00:13:56.860 --> 00:13:57.900
<i>Jiki-kun!</i>

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.320
I'm tired of waiting.

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.230
I'll drag you out right now!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.080
<i>What? That rabbit–!</i>

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:16.130
You're trying to break something.

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.660
You're a bad guy.

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.050
Huh? Something came out.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:25.260
Is that thing helping the mermaid?

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.140
<i>Is that the rabbit from the First Ship?</i>

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>Could it be that malfunctioning rabbit?</i>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.970
<i>That piece of shit!</i>

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.180
<i>This isn't good. If this goes on any longer…</i>

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:40.400
The only place left is inside the theater!

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.530
Iva-neessan?

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.570
Can't you enter from under the apparatus?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:51.620
It's sealed from the inside and we can't open it from here.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.490
Iva-san!

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.040
Tsukumo-san is locked in the bottle on the stage!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.250
Jiki-san is trying to break the bottle,

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:03.210
but the rabbit from the First Ship is preventing him from doing so!

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.590
I see.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:10.590
All of you, act according to my instructions!

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.060
What?
What?

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:15.470
B-But we don't even have scripts!

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.650
It hurts...

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:23.070
<i>Everyone...</i>

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.030
Serves you right, Jiki-sama.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:36.460
I've decided to work with the rabbit and these people to punish you.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:37.660
<i>Iva-san?</i>

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:39.460
Dammit.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:46.260
Me? Oh, I'm so glad you're alive, our sweet little sister!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:50.010
We became human in order to save you.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.550
Our little sister!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:55.800
Everyone, bow!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:16:00.900
Come, return to the castle with your brothers.

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.060
Our little sister!

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.690
They're helping others.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.070
They're good people.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.910
It's time to wake up from this dream and go home.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:23.750
I was worried for a moment there.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.010
The curtains are still up.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:26.710
What?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:30.800
I'll punish you for dumping me and chasing a little girl like her!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:31.630
Huh?

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.680
That bastard, he's two-timing?!

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:35.390
He's the enemy of all women!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:39.810
What are you doing putting Tsukumo in danger?

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.600
Wait, Iva-san?

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:45.480
I will now show you the consequences of your actions.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:48.320
I-Iva–!

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.690
You will address me as "my Queen"!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.700
Go for it, nee-chan! Get him!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:02.250
Tsukumo-chan, everyone, are you all okay?

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.670
Thank you.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.830
I'm fine.

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.390
It's such a relief, isn't it?

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:15.600
When everything turns out okay, even incidents like these can be fun memories–

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:16.720
"Fun," my ass.

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:20.850
Now, how 'bout I teach you a lesson?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.520
What? Why?

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.940
You already punched me once...

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:27.900
Wait!

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:32.030
You should be thanking me for going easy on you with a slap!

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:36.660
I'm so glad.

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.240
Huh?

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.410
The hell?

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:43.290
Gareki-kun has been so depressed lately.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.710
I'm so happy that you've recovered enough to hit me.

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:50.920
I'm really glad that I got to march in the parade with you.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.590
Dammit. You lost it or something?

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:57.350
How did you like your first parade?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:58.720
Did you have fun?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.850
<i>Fun</i>?! You shittin' me?! That was my <i>last</i> parade!

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.520
In the first place, what the hell's with this “Sparkling Prince”?

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:05.730
It's retarded!

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.400
The night has only just begun!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.450
Let's all go out for a night on the town!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:18.490
Jeez...

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:22.120
We would have been watching this in the front row.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:24.670
It's all that doctor's fault.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:27.120
We're working overtime because of him.

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.620
Shh! Formation Alpha!

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:35.380
Akari-sensei, you're such a hard worker!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:40.350
But there was a show going on tonight. You must have received lots of invitations, right?

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:42.600
You must be a real ladies' man, huh?

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:47.350
I keep my distance from women.

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.730
Impressive!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.230
Well, if you'll excuse me…

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.360
Huh?

00:18:55.860 --> 00:18:57.820
<i>What the hell is that supposed to mean?</i>

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.410
<i>We couldn't watch the play because of you!</i>

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:04.620
<i>Don't you dare think all girls are shallow enough to fall for your looks, money, and power.</i>

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.920
<i>I really wish someone would shut Akari-sensei down hard!</i>

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:12.000
<i>At least let </i>him<i> suffer for once!</i>

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:15.300
Oh, Akari-sensei!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.600
Azana, what happened to your face?

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:22.220
It seems like I didn't try hard enough...

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:30.610
It seems quite attached to you, Sensei.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:34.320
<i>I haven't even shown it one ounce of kindness.</i>

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:36.570
Well, here's the report…

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.620
<i>There's nothing wrong with the food and ventilation.</i>

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.080
<i>The plants in the cage are fresh,</i>

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:45.000
<i>but it would feel more secure if there were a greater variety of plants....</i>

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.580
<i>in there to match its original environment.</i>

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:50.580
Sensei, your report…

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:53.550
<i>Why is it so attached to me?</i>

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:55.590
<i>It's impossible to understand.</i>

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.680
What's that smell?

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:02.100
Smoked Taruneru.

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.470
Don't eat that here!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.680
This place will reek for days.

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:10.610
It's been a long day, and I'm in no mood to see either of you.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.440
My cells will die out with all the stress you cause me.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.440
Your very existence is obstructing my daily activities.

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.900
You should work. Work yourselves to death!

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:24.780
Only when you collapse will I bring myself to look at the two of you.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:29.460
You're just upset because you never take any breaks.

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.250
What's that?

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:33.790
Please sit down. We can't discuss things in a civil manner if you're standing.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.040
This is <i>my</i> research laboratory!

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.130
All right, all right.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.880
Let's just have a glass of wine.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.720
I have no reason to drink with you!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.300
Cheers!

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:49.680
You shouldn't have gotten him drunk.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:52.150
You're the one who kept pouring him drinks.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.310
And <i>you're</i> the one who encouraged him.

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:57.310
Now, how was it?

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:03.370
Well, you could say that ending the distribution route is an accomplishment.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:06.870
But we still don't know where it came from.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.330
So, can you go to Rinoll in my place?

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.790
Don't look at me like that!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.170
Think of it as a vacation in the snow.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:21.220
It'll be an easy investigation, you'll just be verifying a few things.

00:21:21.220 --> 00:21:24.170
It's not that cold… it's just…

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.930
Well, it is kinda cold.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:36.940
Every once in a while, it can be quite the vacation for the young ones.

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.610
It's so cold…

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:46.370
Let's finish up and head home right away.

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:48.160
Wait a sec.

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:51.370
Okay, I got the flag set up somewhere unexpected.

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.300
What's up with these pictures?

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.970
They're all photos of Tsukumo as a mermaid!

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.300
Well, I just happened to take them.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:32.890
It seems I need to teach your body another lesson.

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.850
But the play's over, Iva-san.

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:35.930
Iva-san?

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.180
I mean, my Queen!
